WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,740
Disciple Master Chu, I met Elder Fang

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:07,590
Yue Yu is gone, but you are immature.

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,190
He will be a second-level lord so soon.

4
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:12,890
The elders meet each other, but the disciple’s talent remains

5
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,990
You can only catch it diligently, don’t be too modest

6
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:17,890
I've heard everything about you

7
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:21,190
If I can sit in this position, you have merit too

8
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:24,890
I asked Tong'er to bring you here today because I wanted to ask you a question

9
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:27,590
Are you willing to become my teacher?

10
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:29,550
I am now an elder

11
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:32,650
According to the rules, accepting a disciple must be at least an outside disciple.

12
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:35,450
This time Chi Xiao Dabi, if you can enter the top ten

13
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,250
I will accept you as my disciple

14
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:41,040
I, Junior Brother Chu, am your disciple. This is really a great thing.

15
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,140
From now on, we will be brothers and sisters from the same school.

16
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,440
Fang Qingshan is recruiting disciples because he thinks I am useful.

17
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:46,840
But even though the adopted son doesn’t know the purpose

18
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,040
But I really want to see me break through the upper limit of my talent

19
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:50,600
Or just say it well

20
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:55,400
You have only been in the sect for more than a month, so it is not easy to break through to the second level.

21
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,100
It’s normal to not have confidence

22
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,600
But I believe it

23
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:00,800
Elders love their disciples and are grateful

24
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:03,730
Of course the top ten disciples have confidence

25
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:06,230
An elder loves his disciples and dare not refuse them

26
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:08,330
There's just one thing I need to write first
